 : ابصار","hi":"नज़र / आंख : अबसार (आंखें)"}},{"id":"s1l10_g3_w28","arabic":"شَيْطَان : شَيَاطِين","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">شَيْطَان</span> : <span class=\"arabic-root\">شَيَاطِين</span>","hinglish":"Shaytan : Shayaateen","translations":{"en":"Devil / Satan : Devils / Satans","ur":"شیطان : شیاطین","hi":"शैतान : शयातीन (शैतान)"}},{"id":"s1l10_g3_w29","arabic":"غَيْب : غُيُوب","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">غَيْب : غُيُوب</span>","hinglish":"Ghaib : Ghuyoob","translations":{"en":"Unseen : Unseen things / Mysteries","ur":"غیب : غیوب","hi":"ग़ैब : ग़ुयूब (परोक्ष/छिपी बातें)"}},{"id":"s1l10_g3_w30","arabic":"يَد : أَيْدِي","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">يَد : أَيْدِي</span>","hinglish":"Haath : Aydii","translations":{"en":"Hand : Hands","ur":"ہاتھ : ایدی (ہاتھ)","hi":"हाथ : ऐदी (हाथ)"}}],"cols":3}},{"id":"sec_s1l10_r4","type":"rule_paragraph","data":{"text":"Yeh jama ke alfaaz Qur'an-e-Majeed mein baar baar aate hain. Inhe achhi tarah yaad karein aur [الـ] ke saath mila kar buland aawaz se padhne ki koshish karein."}},{"id":"sec_s1l10_r5","type":"rule_paragraph","data":{"text":"Arabi zaban mein jama ke alfaaz aam taur par muannath (feminine) shumar hote hain. Upar zikr kiye gaye tamam jama alfaaz muannath hain."}},{"id":"sec_s1l10_lbl6","type":"section_label","data":{"text":"Darj zail Qur'ani aayaat mein se jama ke alfaaz pehchaniye:"}},{"id":"sec_s1l10_v7","type":"two_col_numbered_list","data":{"is_numbered":true,"items":[{"id":"s1l10_v7_s1","sentence_number":1,"arabic":"لَا تَسْأَلُوا عَنْ أَشْيَاءَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">لَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">تَسْأَل</span><span class=\"nonroot\">ُوا</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">عَنْ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">أَشْيَاءَ</span>","hinglish":"Ashyaa ke baare mein na poocho","translations":{"ur":"اشیاء کے بارے میں نہ پوچھو","en":"Do not ask about things","hi":"चीज़ों के बारे में न पूछो"},"ref":"5:101"},{"id":"s1l10_v7_s2","sentence_number":2,"arabic":"وَأَنَّ الْمَسَاجِدَ لِلَّهِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">وَأَنَّ الْمَسَاجِدَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">لِلَّهِ</span>","hinglish":"Aur beshak masajid Allah ke liye hain","translations":{"en":"And that the mosques are for Allah","ur":"اور کہ مسجدیں اللہ ہی کے لیے ہیں","hi":"और कि मस्जिदें अल्लाह ही के लिए हैं"},"ref":"72:18"},{"id":"s1l10_v7_s3","sentence_number":3,"arabic":"وَلَهُمْ أَعْمَالٌ مِنْ دُونِ ذَلِكَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">وَل</span><span class=\"nonroot\">َهُمْ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">أَعْمَالٌ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">مِنْ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">دُونِ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">ذَلِكَ</span>","hinglish":"Aur unke liye iske ilawa bhi a'maal hain","translations":{"ur":"اور ان کے لیے اس کے علاوہ بھی اعمال ہیں","en":"And they have deeds besides that","hi":"और उनके लिए इसके अलावा भी आमाल हैं"},"ref":"23:63"},{"id":"s1l10_v7_s4","sentence_number":4,"arabic":"لَهُمْ قُلُوبٌ لَا يَفْقَهُونَ بِهَا","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">لَهُمْ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">قُلُوبٌ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">لَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">يَفْقَه</span><span class=\"nonroot\">ُونَ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">بِهَا</span>","hinglish":"Unke paas dil hain jinse woh samajhte nahi","translations":{"ur":"ان کے پاس دل ہیں جن سے وہ سمجھتے نہیں","en":"They have hearts with which they do not understand","hi":"उनके पास दिल हैं जिनसे वे समझते नहीं"},"ref":"7:179"},{"id":"s1l10_v7_s5","sentence_number":5,"arabic":"وَإِذَا النُّفُوسُ زُوِّجَتْ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">وَإِذَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">النُّفُوسُ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">زُوِّج</span><span class=\"nonroot\">َتْ</span>","hinglish":"Aur jab jaanein jodi jayeingi","translations":{"ur":"اور جب جانیں جوڑی جائیں گی","en":"And when the souls are paired","hi":"और जब जानें जोड़ी जाएँगी"},"ref":"81:7"},{"id":"s1l10_v7_s6","sentence_number":6,"arabic":"تِلْكَ حُدُودُ اللَّهِ فَلَا تَقْرَبُوهَا","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">تِلْكَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">حُدُودُ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">اللَّهِ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">فَلَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">تَقْرَبُوهَا</span>","hinglish":"Yeh Allah ki hudood hain toh unke qareeb na jao","translations":{"ur":"یہ اللہ کی حدود ہیں تو ان کے قریب نہ جاؤ","en":"These are the limits of Allah, so do not approach them","hi":"यह अल्लाह की हुदूद हैं तो उनके क़रीब न जाओ"},"ref":"2:187"},{"id":"s1l10_v7_s7","sentence_number":7,"arabic":"وَإِلَى اللَّهِ تُرْجَعُ الْأُمُورُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">وَإِلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">اللَّهِ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">تُرْجَعُ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">الْ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">أُمُورُ</span>","hinglish":"Aur Allah hi ki taraf sab kaam lautaaye jaate hain","translations":{"ur":"اور اللہ ہی کی طرف سب کام لوٹائے جاتے ہیں","en":"And to Allah are returned all matters","hi":"और अल्लाह ही की तरफ़ सब काम लौटाए जाते हैं"},"ref":"2:210"},{"id":"s1l10_v7_s8","sentence_number":8,"arabic":"وَلَا تَنَابَزُوا بِالْأَلْقَابِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">وَلَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">تَنَابَز</span><span class=\"nonroot\">ُوا</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">بِالْ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">أَلْقَابِ</span>","hinglish":"Aur ek doosre ko bure alqab se na pukaro","translations":{"ur":"اور ایک دوسرے کو برے القاب سے نہ پکارو","en":"And do not call each other by offensive nicknames","hi":"और एक दूसरे को बुरे अलक़ाब से न पुकारो"},"ref":"49:11"},{"id":"s1l10_v7_s9","sentence_number":9,"arabic":"فَانْظُرْ إِلَى آثَارِ رَحْمَةِ اللَّهِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">فَانْظُرْ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">إِلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">آثَارِ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">رَحْمَةِ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">اللَّهِ</span>","hinglish":"Toh Allah ki rehmat ke aathaar ki taraf dekho","translations":{"ur":"تو اللہ کی رحمت کے آثار کی طرف دیکھو","en":"So observe the effects of the mercy of Allah","hi":"तो अल्लाह की रहमत के आसार की तरफ़ देखो"},"ref":"30:50"}],"cols":3}}]}}